Cell["\<\
KVP in Lucchese\[CloseCurlyQuote]s general parametrization
Note that for L=K this is (slightly) different from Taylor\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
parametrization
The difference is whether one solves for K or K/p [=tau]; the latter might \
actually be more numerically stable\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.82395161595392*^9, 3.823951643466526*^9}, {
